---

Scope of this licence

This licence covers the text and documentation files in this repository only.

It does NOT cover:
  - the AI Ball product, its source code, its models or its infrastructure,
    none of which are published or licensed here;
  - the underlying football data shown on https://aiball.samagent.ai, which
    comes from a commercial feed under its own terms and is not ours to
    relicense;
  - the AI Ball name, logo and other brand marks.

Why CC BY 4.0 rather than a software licence: everything in this repository
is prose and specification rather than code. A software licence such as MIT
is drafted around source, object form and warranty disclaimers, and says
little that is useful about a document. CC BY says precisely what we mean
about text — attribution required, derivatives allowed, commercial use
allowed, no further restrictions — and it travels well: a student quoting our
ledger rules in a report, a maintainer quoting us in a curated list, or a
journalist quoting our stated limits is covered without needing to ask us.
